    {
      "id": "01-opening-question",
      "role": "female",
      "chapter": "opening",
      "text": "营收降了14.8%，净利跌了73.1%，研发费用率却在上升，在建工程更涨了139.6%。利润几乎清零，钱为什么还在往研发和建厂里投？",
      "file": "01-opening-question-female.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "duration_seconds": 13.896,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "duration_frames": 417,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "02-opening-answer",
      "role": "male",
      "chapter": "opening",
      "text": "作为国内汽车刹车片龙头，金麒麟的矛盾很清楚：短期利润收缩，长期投入却在加速。",
      "file": "02-opening-answer-male.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 14.176,
      "duration_seconds": 8.256,
      "start_frame": 425,
      "duration_frames": 248,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "03-research-question",
      "role": "female",
      "chapter": "research",
      "text": "先看研发。二季度研发费用率4.32%，同比提高1.02个百分点；营收下滑，研发反增，投向哪里？",
      "file": "03-research-question-female.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 22.712,
      "duration_seconds": 9.504,
      "start_frame": 681,
      "duration_frames": 285,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "04-research-context",
      "role": "male",
      "chapter": "research",
      "text": "公司正从传统液压制动转向电子刹车和线控制动，技术窗口只剩两到三年。",
      "file": "04-research-context-male.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 32.496,
      "duration_seconds": 8.832,
      "start_frame": 975,
      "duration_frames": 265,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "05-research-proof-question",
      "role": "female",
      "chapter": "research",
      "text": "怎样验证这笔投入不是浪费？",
      "file": "05-research-proof-question-female.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 41.608,
      "duration_seconds": 2.448,
      "start_frame": 1248,
      "duration_frames": 73,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "06-research-proof-answer",
      "role": "male",
      "chapter": "research",
      "text": "看Q3主机厂定点。拿到定点，投入开始兑现；如果还在改良旧产品，就是方向性浪费。",
      "file": "06-research-proof-answer-male.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 44.336,
      "duration_seconds": 9.072,
      "start_frame": 1330,
      "duration_frames": 272,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "07-construction-question",
      "role": "female",
      "chapter": "construction",
      "text": "再看在建工程，0.4亿元，同比涨139.6%。业绩收缩时，为什么还要继续建厂？",
      "file": "07-construction-question-female.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 53.688,
      "duration_seconds": 8.064,
      "start_frame": 1611,
      "duration_frames": 242,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "08-construction-answer",
      "role": "male",
      "chapter": "construction",
      "text": "产能建设要一到两年，对应的是2027到2028年的供给。技术转型会淘汰小厂，龙头可能拿到更多份额。前提是，现金流能撑到需求回暖；关键要看钱来自自有现金，还是新增借款。",
      "file": "08-construction-answer-male.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 62.032,
      "duration_seconds": 15.84,
      "start_frame": 1861,
      "duration_frames": 475,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "09-operations-question",
      "role": "female",
      "chapter": "operations",
      "text": "公司的运营体质，能承受这场押注吗？",
      "file": "09-operations-question-female.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 78.152,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "start_frame": 2345,
      "duration_frames": 97,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "10-turnover-answer",
      "role": "male",
      "chapter": "operations",
      "text": "固定资产周转率1.53次，处在正常区间下沿；周转降幅小于营收，更像主动压缩低效产能。Q3营收回到4.5亿元以上，周转率会修复。",
      "file": "10-turnover-answer-male.mp3",
      "start_seconds": 81.672,
      "duration_seconds": 12.864,
      "start_frame": 2450,
      "duration_frames": 386,
      "gap_after_seconds": 0.28
    },
    {
      "id": "11-capex-question",
      "role": "female",
      "chapter": "operations",
      "text": "资本开支和存货，还会不会继续拖累利润？",
